    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CHLOE: Yeah?\nHALLIE: I, for one, am intrigued but I've got to go get my sister.",
      "WREN: How you doin' kid?\nLIZZIE: I wore the t-shirt you gave me to school. I got sent to the principal’s office.\nWREN: Well done.",
      "CHLOE: Don't make any pregnancy jokes but I felt so nauseous this morning. I threw up twice.\nHALLIE: Have you been having nightmares?\nHALLIE: Have you?\nHALLIE: What was it?",
      "CHLOE: It’s Katie we're waiting for?\nWREN: Yeah. I think.\nHALLIE: Did she seem weird to you today?\nWREN: Weird?",
      "WREN: It cut me off! Her mailbox is full.\nHALLIE: She hasn't answered any of my texts, either.\nWREN: Oh, shit!!\nCHLOE: This is getting serious, people..."
    ]
  },
